$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=lsfiberlem4  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for lsfiber: f times the block of primitive characters mod f is the sum of the squared twisted unit averages over the image of the embedding at level Q (Lean hSigma, hval, himg at one level).

